    {
      "text": "In the arena fight for Sacred Feather City’s kingship, after Coiling Tree Vines binds Dan Yu, Yu Fei activates Crane Crossing Neck. His head suddenly turns into a crane’s head. His long neck coils around Dan Yu’s neck like a long chain, gripping tightly as his beak stabs at Dan Yu. He later turns his head back to normal and follows with Six-nine Great Windmill, winning the match and the featherman kingship.",
